## Working agreement
- **Communicate with the user in their language** (mirror the language they write in).
- Every task runs as an **observable Agent Team**; the reviewer and critic must approve
  before work is reported done — independent review corrects single-agent bias.
- **Do it right the first time:** no temporary measures, no swallowed errors, no silent
  omissions, no "fix later". The critic blocks these.

